<title>UK: UK'S EMAP BUYS TWO AUSTRALIAN FIRMS.</title>
<headline>UK'S EMAP BUYS TWO AUSTRALIAN FIRMS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>British publishing group EMAP Plc said on Monday that it had bought Australian firms Mason Stewart Publishing and Bounty Services for a total of five million stg.</p>
<p>&quot;We believe there is further potential for our magazines in Australia,&quot; said the company in a statement. &quot;These acquisitions will provide us with an excellent base in that part of the world.&quot;</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
